# Web3Forms Production Access Key
# 1. Obtain your free access key at https://web3forms.com by submitting your email (ansafmuadh@gmail.com)
# 2. In Vercel: Go to Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables
# 3. Add Key: VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY, Value: <your_access_key>
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here

